        - !<reference> 8ba2ad3a-33fd-4668-8143-2ecb685001fd
        - !<reference> 7b8e31c6-7d05-49e9-b034-a8b23f89b538
        - !<reference> f66aa37a-6763-41f0-97d1-7a13d4c8665e
        - !<reference> 1b53b435-fc66-45e1-a7d5-24064c832840
        - !<reference> 25e03b4f-3a51-4209-b182-8dc6aac563a2
        - !<reference> d3638c60-a1f2-4c2e-9062-79bb52f95ee6
        - !<reference> 705741f8-db00-446b-83a0-948908f48d35
        - !<reference> cd60643d-c7d3-4424-85ec-c1670d2a328b
        - !<reference> 1fcbbcdb-2d0e-4b71-b6b5-84be42a5565a
        - !<reference> 5853da67-61e2-4d57-b2d1-54b556401561
        - !<reference> 385105a8-699c-4006-93f4-bd65df541e11
        - !<reference> 51556dd3-2a9f-4a9d-9f92-28a949238ef9
        - !<reference> 94e76a77-89a2-448b-a612-c9260c0b9739
        - !<reference> 7c18f98c-1c25-40fa-928f-c24d82e4daaa
        - !<reference> 79108b3f-c8b6-42e3-bcf1-1a77fce6b16b
      exampleInfo: !<string[]>
        - Scatters copies at random points inside a circle around a center point. The scatter is new every time the Lens starts.
        - Places a set number of copies evenly around the edge of a circle.
        - "Spreads a set number of copies evenly along an arc of a circle: here 60 degrees, from a start angle."
        - "Splits a circle into slices and lines up copies along the edge of each slice, drawing a polygon."
        - Spaces a set number of copies evenly along the line between two points.
        - "Lines up copies between two points with a fixed gap between them, so longer lines get more copies."
        - "Lays out copies on a flat grid of rows and columns, centered on a point."
        - "Builds a 3D grid of copies: rows, columns and layers. Move your head to look between the layers."
        - Fills the volume of a box with copies at random points.
        - Fills the volume of a sphere with copies at random points.
        - "Places copies at random points on the faces of a box, leaving it hollow."
        - "Places copies at random points on the surface of a sphere, forming a hollow shell."
        - "A minimal version of the circle scatter: copies at random points inside a circle."
        - Scatters copies at random points inside a square around a center point.
        - Fills the collider of another object (the outlined box) with copies of random sizes.
      steps: !<reference.SceneObject[]>
        []
      stepInfo: !<string[]>
        []
      startIndex: !<float> 0.000000
      previousLabel: Previous
      nextLabel: Next
      examplesPushBack: !<float> 100.000000
      anchorExamples: true
      startMinimized: false
      extraPanelDrop: !<float> 0.000000
  ScriptTypes:
    "":
      {}
